{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-03-09 08:00:00', 'title': 'CHARLES RIVER LAUNCHES HELPER PLASMID TO STREAMLINE ADENO-ASSOCIATED VIRAL VECTOR MANUFACTURING', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NYSE: CRL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS OFF-THE-SHELF PHELPER OFFERING, WHICH IS DESIGNED TO SECURE SUPPLY AND STREAMLINE ADENO-ASSOCIATED VIRUS (AAV)-BASED GENE THERAPY PROGRAMS FROM EARLY DISCOVERY THROUGH COMMERCIAL MANUFACTURING. IT IS AVAILABLE IMMEDIATELY IN RESEARCH GRADE (RG), HIGH QUALITY (HQ), AND GOOD MANUFACTURING PRACTICE (GMP)-GRADE.'}